+## Closed 2026-08-12 — Doug's call, with the gap accepted rather than fixed here
+
+Standalone Trail exists and is green. `~/git/trail`, jj colocated, 10 commits, 487 tests across 32 files, tsc clean, zero `sandpiper` in production source or the built binary. Four slices landed in order, each with its own gate: TCL-147 path/config module, TCL-148 neutral `.trail` defaults, TCL-149 strict total parse with exact version match, TCL-150 `initialize`. Rollback point `pmzmvzly`.
+
+Closed knowing `initialize`'s never-overwrite check is incomplete against settled design — it tests `.trail/config.json` alone where the rule is *any* candidate path. Inert today because only one candidate exists; it becomes wrong the moment TCL-161 lands, and TCL-161 carries the fix.
+
+### Where the remaining work lives
+
+Settled design not yet built:
