+| **TCL-163** | Tasks-dir override key. Blocks the migration tool; also makes TCL-151's correct fix structural |
+| **TCL-161** | Three config candidates, first match wins, plus the `initialize` overwrite gap above |
+| **TCL-162** | Remove `storage init`, fold into `initialize` |
+| **TCL-157** | Migration tool for the twelve boards. Needs TCL-163 |
+
+Cutover and cleanup: **TCL-156** (vendor + toon 4.x rollout, a one-way door), **TCL-158** (purge sandpiper naming from test fixtures), **TCL-159** (split this repo's Trail docs; harvest the design record after 161/162/163), **TCL-160** (move the TCL board into the Trail repo, blocked on 156).
+
+Found during this work and outliving it: **TCL-151** (mutation with a malformed config writes, reports success, then crashes), **TCL-153** (`storage migrate` silently ignores `mode.repo`), **TCL-155** (a bracket in a task title wedged the board — toon bumped to 4.1.1; `index update` resilience still open), **TCL-154** (`bun test` runs the wrong runner and fabricates failures), **TCL-145** (frontmatter guard false positive).
+
+TCL-151, TCL-152 and TCL-153 share one signature worth carrying forward: a command reporting its *intent* rather than its *result*, every one invisible to tests asserting exit codes and stdout instead of resulting VCS state.
